WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.890
Now we move from text to temporal data The first
decision is the data

00:00:05.917 --> 00:00:12.290
type DATE represents a calendar date TIMESTAMP

00:00:12.303 --> 00:00:18.157
represents a date and clock time without time-zone
interpretation TIMESTAMPTZ

00:00:18.183 --> 00:00:25.869
represents an instant in time INTERVAL represents a
duration Choosing

00:00:25.895 --> 00:00:29.382
the correct type is more important than choosing a
formatting function
